# Rich Web Fixture {#rich}

This fixture covers **strong**, *emphasis*, `code`, [safe links](https://example.com),
variables like {{vars.missing}}, and references such as @[table].

:::style
h1 { color: #0f766e; }
:::

| Name | Value |
| - | - |
| AST | canonical |
| NCP | semantic |

:::note {#table fallback="children"}
The table is referenced by a stable ID.
